# Store and check out text files with LF line endings on every platform.
#
# Migrations matter most: SQLx records a checksum of each applied migration
# and refuses to run if the file changes, so a migration checked out with
# CRLF on Windows would no longer match the databases it was applied to.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
